[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ciwob"]
script = ExtResource("5_not4f")
markedup_text = "Take them to the mountains."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_06ahh")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_bte88")
markedup_result_text = "The nun takes the children to the highlands, away from the bustle of the town.

She makes them contemplate their surroundings: the does grazing down by the stream, the rays of sunshine, fading as the sun sinks below the horizon, the Cloud Sea stretching far into the distance.

As the trips repeat, she makes them vocalize sacred sounds at different pitches, and teaches them holy chants. When a storm comes during one such trip, she leads them in a chant enumerating the practices most favored by the Enlightened One.

One day the settlers find the merchant's house empty, with no sign of him, the children, or the nun."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_8nqtt"]
script = ExtResource("14_msdyr")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://foju0o4i75rv"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_nthfn"]
script = ExtResource("5_not4f")
markedup_text = "Take them through the town."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_8nqtt")
markedup_result_text = "The nun listens as the merchant lists rules that his children must follow, gives schedules for their lessons, and lays out the plan for them to take over the family business.

Once the father leaves, the nun gathers his ledgers, ties them to bamboo poles, and strides into the square with the children in tow. They spend the rest of the day flying these kites, before finally letting the wind claim them.

The next day the merchant discovers his ledgers gone. Furious, he disowns the children on the spot and sends them off with the nun to her monastery."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_2myy3"]
script = ExtResource("3_sh5fw")
markedup_text = "Onlookers gawk as a young woman drifts down from the sky, her hand gripping an umbrella. She folds it and taps it against her shoulder.

Despite her rich dress, she introduces herself as a nun. When questioned about her arrival, she curtly replies \"I never explain anything.\"

She takes one glance at the notice board, then walks to the house of a widowed merchant, accepting a job as his children's tutor. Before the sun sets, she decides to take the children on an outing.
"
background_image = SubResource("Resource_tuogj")
background_credit = ExtResource("4_papv8")
choices = Array[ExtResource("5_not4f")]([SubResource("Resource_dpp3j"), SubResource("Resource_ciwob")])
exit_choice = SubResource("Resource_nthfn")

